ZEHRA TERI DUA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA ALLAH KI ATAA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
1. HAR HAAL MAY HUSSAIN KA MATAM KARENGE HUM BESHAK HUM ISS YAQEEN SE KARTEY HAIN SHAI KA GHAM HAR DARD KI DAWA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
2. TEENAT MAY HAI HAMARI GHAM E SHAI MILA HUWA MAABOOD KI YEH HUM PA KARAM KI HAI INTEHA QISMAT MAY LIKHDIYA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
3. AATI HAI MULKE SHAAM SE YE AAJ BHI SADA ZAALIM KOI BHI HOO NA IISAY ROOK PAYEGA ZAINAB KA MAREKA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
4. MATAM PE SHAHE DEEN KI JAAN APNI HAI NISAR FARSHE AZA PE ROONE KO RAHTE HAIN BEQARAR TASKEEN E FATIMA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
5. FARSHE AZA BICHAYENGE ROOKAR HUSSAIN KA DENGI DUAEIN FATIMA ZEHRA HAMAY SADA ARMAAN E FATIMA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
6. SHABBIR NE QUDA KE LIYE SAR KATADIYA GHAR BAAR KO WILAYATE HAQQ PAR LUTA DIYA EMAAN KI BAQA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
7. MATAM TOU HOGA AAP NA HAIRAT SE DEKHIYE<br>
<br>
DUMB HO TOU AAKAY MAJLIS E SHABBIR ROKIYE MOMIN KA HOUSLA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
 8. PARDA HATAAKE AAYEGA ZAIGHAM HUSSAIN KA KAABE PE PHIR LAGAYEGA PARCHAM HUSSAIN KA HAAN QWAHISH E QUDA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
9. HOGA GHAM E HUSSAIN HAMARI NISHIST MAY MAA ROYEGI HUSSAIN KI BAGH E BEHISHT MAY ZEHRA NE BHI KIYA HAI YEH MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
10. ZANJEER HUM LAGATE HAIN DARTE HAIN AAP KYUN KHOON APNA HIM BAHATE HAIN DARTE HAIN AAP KYUN CHAHAT KA MOJIIZA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
11. KAISE LIKHEGA HASHMI NOUHA BATAA MUJHE ALFAAZ KEHRAHE HAIN KE NOUHA SUNA MUJHE AASHOOR KI SADA HAI YE MATAM HUSSAIN KA<br>
<br>
